# Asher Documentation

Generic documentation principles (when to document, change/decision entry format, avoiding
duplication, keeping docs aligned with implementation) live in the global `AGENTS.md`.

Asher-specific canonical locations live in the project `AGENTS.md` → *Canonical locations*. Do not
duplicate protocol method lists or smoke-test commands across docs — link the canonical location.

After significant changes, update the retired/deferred lists in `AGENTS.md` if they change.
